  "historyNote": "#1867, eff 11-22-81: ss by #2260, eff 1-5-83; ss by #2914, eff 11-27-84; ss by #4600, eff 8-1-89; ss by #6094-B, INTERIM, eff 9-21-95, EXPIRED: 1-19-96 New. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96; amd by #6933, eff 2-1-99; paragraphs (a)-(f) EXPIRED: 2-5-04; amd by #8316, eff 3-26-05; paragraph (g) EXPIRED: 2-1-07; paragraphs (a)-(f) EXPIRED: 3-26-13 New. #10812, eff 4-18-15; ss by #13117, eff 10-15-20",
